flowchart TB
    subgraph prep [Data preparation]
        direction LR
        X[ASRS export<br/>3,080 reports] --> P[Expand abbreviations<br/>in search text] --> D[(DuckDB +<br/>embedding index)]
    end

    subgraph filter [1. Build a filter]
        direction TB
        Q[Question] --> F[LLM tool call<br/>build_filter → JSON spec]
        F --> V[Validate against<br/>observed field values]
        V -- "rejected:<br/>reasons sent back<br/>(up to 3 calls)" --> F
        V -- valid --> S[Run filter in DuckDB]
    end

    subgraph answer [2. Retrieve and answer]
        direction TB
        R[Hybrid retrieval over<br/>filtered narratives<br/>BM25 + dense, RRF] --> A[LLM answer from top 10<br/>each claim cites an ACN]
        A --> C[Check every cited ACN<br/>verified / not shown /<br/>not in corpus]
        C --> O[Answer + verified sources]
    end

    prep --> filter
    prep --> answer
